{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/787768-demon-the-fallen-mold-earth-error","id":787768,"title":"Demon: the Fallen - Mold Earth error?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-16T19:01:06-08:00","id":787768,"title":"Demon: the Fallen - Mold Earth error?","content":"All of the Lore of Earth evocations use the Survival ability except for the Mold Earth evocation which uses crafts. Given that you aren't really creating anything complex with this evocation and making crude structures should be covered under Survival am I right in thinking that this was probably a mistake?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T19:41:26-08:00","id":787789,"title":"","content":"Nope it's crafts, your crafting something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T20:15:54-08:00","id":787801,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/787768-demon-the-fallen-mold-earth-error?p=787789#post787789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nope it's crafts, your crafting something.</div> </div> </div> </div>But it's a limited, crude crafting akin to building your own outdoor shelter, which is a Survival task.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T20:19:38-08:00","id":787803,"title":"","content":"Still crafting something. However you house rule it is up to you but the lore comes from the house of artificers and builders. Not preppers and survival experts","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3953,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","user":"Dwight","date":".  reasons 12-16-2015, 11:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T02:21:26-08:00","id":1015184,"title":"","content":"My 2 cents.<br /> <br /> Honestly, the characteristic + skill for Lores was a bad idea from beginning. Exactly for the same reason as seen here, and this is not the worst example. What has fire to do with survival? No, do not tell me you rub to sticks together to make fire or I will run of screaming. Or medicine with death? You are the angel of creation even in your limited form, Lore should not work along human logic, and they do not, obviously<br /> I dropped the whole shebang and use Permanent Faith/2 + Lore. Period.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4084-michaelsd","name":"MichaelSD","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T05:42:55-08:00","id":1015225,"title":"","content":"This is the reason I house rule it to lore + permanent faith for the roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T12:30:05-08:00","id":1015334,"title":"","content":"Actually, sometime ago I houseruled the Lores, creating corresponding Wisdoms (asymetric Knowledge). These Wisdoms are organized halfway between the Mage's Spheres and the Changeling's Realms (Life Wisdom, Matter Wisdom, Forces Wisdom, Demon Wisdom, Spirit Wisdom, etc. ), they are 10 and interact differently with each Lore (it's not &quot;1 Wisdom for each Lore&quot;).<br /> So, for example the Lore of Earth used the Demon Wisdom for the 1st power, Matter Wisdom for the 2nd/3rd/5th power, Forces Wisdom for the 4th power.<br /> Unfortunately I don't remember all the chart (lost when my previous computer got fried), but it's along these lines...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>========================